      "id": 1,
      "claim": "\"Totally legal\" means an activity that is permitted by law and does not constitute a criminal offence, even if the activity is subject to regulatory conditions (e.g., licensing, age limits).",
      "evidence": "Legal definition: an act is legal when the penal code does not prescribe a sanction for it; de‑criminalised or tolerated activities that remain listed as illegal offences are not \"totally legal\".",
      "weight": 0.20,
      "depends_on": []
    },
